window.products.push({"id":169002,"name":"Eastman Outdoors 37063 30-Quart Whole Enchilada Professional Outdoor Cooking Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PKQS1HDJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Eastman Outdoors makes it easy to be an outdoor chef with professional quality cookware. This set includes 30-quart pot with stamped oil level markings, a 10-1/2-quart pot and two all purpose baskets. Kit also includes turkey stand, lift hook, 12\" AccuZone thermometer, and 2-oz.Marinade injector. Amazon.com Cooking fish, poultry, and other meats outdoors is a tricky proposition, and an investment of time, energy and money. Sometimes things don't turn out like they should. You get caught up in conversation and forget to check the grill, and the next thing you know you're left with a large quantity of dry, overcooked and expensive meat, and still-hungry guests. This 30-quart outdoor cooking set is the best way to ensure things run smoothly, and that guests and family enjoy juicy, gourmet-quality meats, and more! The set features an 18/8 Italian stainless steel pot with a heavy-duty lid for sealing in flavor and keeping meats tender. A handy turkey stand holds the bird at just the right height for even cooking. A lift hook pulls foods from the cooker with ease. The kit's 12-inch AccuZone thermometer ensures even cooking temperatures from top to bottom. And, Eastman's 2-ounce Monster Marinade Injector applies favorite sauces and brines. A 10-1/2-quart aluminum fish-fry pot and basket adds to this set's incredible versatility. Not sure how often you'd use it? A 30-minute outdoor cooking video is full of cooking ideas that must be tried. A large aluminum basket is perfect for quick steaming of sides of veggies to go with all those delectable entrees you'll create. --Brian Olson","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PKQS1HDJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easton","source_asin":"B000AXSJDW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000AXSJDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000AXSJDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
