window.products.push({"id":169006,"name":"Portable Air Pump for Inflatables,Electric Air Mattress Pump Rechargeable 4000mAh Battery Powered Quick-Fill Inflator Deflator for Airbed Inflatable P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA9ZgwqHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Cordless Air Pump】This battery powered air pump is compact and lightweight, you can easily carry it to use at anywhere. while other wired pump only work when plugged into a wall outlet.The battery air pump is designed with a USB charging port, which can support charging ways of power banks, adapters, and tablet computers and so on 【4000mAh Rechargeable Battery Powered】The built-in 4000mAh battery of our air pump can work for 30-40 minutes after being fully charged, that is to say, it can inflate 45pcs ordinary air mattress, while other small air pumps can only inflate a few air beds. And there are 4 battery level indicator on the air pump, you can charge in time when the battery is in low power 【3 Different Sizes Nozzles for Multiple Inflatables】S size nozzle is ideal for small inflatable toys like swimming rings;M size nozzle is ideal for splash mat, swimming pool, camping pad,rafts;L size nozzle is ideal for high-volume inflatables like air beds, air boats, bounce boats 【Powerful & Quick Inflator/Deflator】The pool float pump with 3300Pa air pressure and 250L/min airflow make this air pump achieve rapid inflation or deflation. We are proud of its high efficiency that It only takes 45 seconds to fully fill an air mattress bed 【CUSTOMER SATISFACTION】If the air pump does not meet your expectations, please feel free to contact us, we guarantee free return or exchange within 30 days.Note:Don't inflate high pressure products like basketball,balloon,tyre,etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA9ZgwqHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECHSHARE","source_asin":"B0B28J2JQJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B28J2JQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B28J2JQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
