window.products.push({"id":169069,"name":"Large Anime Canvas Print Wall Art by Emperpep – Happy Sunflower – 30x48 Inch Canvas Picture Stretched On A Wooden Frame – Giclee Canvas Printing – Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PcqFrJmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Got It? Hang It! Lightweight and easy to hang, your wall art canvas will add a touch of unique style to your space. Adorn Your Interior With A Pinch Of Art Our immediate environment has a huge impact on our mood. Why not make your living quarters a happier place to be? Gallery of Innovative Art offers a wide selection of artworks from exceptionally talented artists that convince with outstanding sharpness and intense colors. From abstract art to nature photos, children’s collections and more! The Artist: Emperpep is a freelance illustrator from Thailand whose favorite art style is colorful, psychedelic anime art. He manipulates nature’s creations into something cute, using random chaotic composition, yet somewhat mathematically structured, so that it doesn't look too messed up. The artist prefers traditional to digital painting as he likes seeing how pigment and color behaves on paper and canvas. He makes art to inspire children so they can have more motivation and appreciation for it. Fine American Quality by one of the world's leading wall decor manufacturers Handcrafted in USA: all canvas prints are produced and hand-stretched in sunny Miami Solvent-free Ink: odorless and can be used by someone with allergies and in kids' rooms Printed in the giclée technique: Gallery Wrapped edges Certified artist grade canvas (300g/m²): created for canvas wall art Light-weight pine wooden frame: please note the hanging hardware is not included however the paintings can easily be hung on a regular nail We Go Green Apart from loving art, Gallery of Innovative Art cares about other important aspects of life. This is why we run our business using green electricity from renewable sources like wind, hydro and solar power. Caring for the environment is caring for yourself. Click “Add To Cart” Now And Receive The Finest Quality Prints","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PcqFrJmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gallery of innovative art","source_asin":"B01GS0T6N2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GS0T6N2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GS0T6N2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
