window.products.push({"id":169093,"name":"Pinch Pleated 3pc Duvet Cover Set 100% Egyptian Cotton 1000 Thread Count Zipper & Corner Ties Rectangle Pattern Decorative Pintuck Pillow Shams (120X9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3JjVq0LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pinch Pleated 3pc Duvet Cover Set 100% Egyptian Cotton 1000 Thread Count Zipper & Corner Ties Rectangle Pattern Decorative Pintuck Pillow Shams (120X98 Oversize King, Steal Blue) <p>✔HIDDEN ZIPPER & CORNER TIES - The hidden zipper closure is more convenient and beautiful than other closure. We have a flap to cover the zipper closure so that it is invisible and durable, making no noises during moving. At the same time, corner ties inside your duvet cover can help secure comforter in the right place from slipping into a pile and keep you comfortable all night long.</p> <p>✔SOFT & SATIN SMOOTH – Our Duvet Covers are made with sateen weave construction, which makes it soft and silky. The fabric is made of cotton that is naturally grown which makes it smooth without affecting your skin. We only use extra-long staple cotton fiber to give you a long lasting, high quality, soft and silky, hotel like feel right at home. In addition, cotton being a naturally breathable fabric, helps in a good night’s sleep every time.</p> <p>✔100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Just try our products and if you don't absolutely love them let us know and we will refund your purchase price. We are so confident you will love our products like our other 5-star reviewers! You will be amazed at the customer service you receive after the sale! You have nothing to lose so ORDER NOW and consider buying an extra set for your loved ones. Makes the perfect gift for any occasion!</p> <p>✔PINCH PLEAT ELEGANT DESIGN: 1000 TC Duvet Covers are crafted with pinch pleat puckered diamonds. Our comforter covers are available in a wide range of vibrant colors. The craftsmanship of 600 threads per inch provides a blend of softness, durability, and year-round comfort—use the cooling duvet covers in the summer or layer in the winter.</p> <p>✔DURABLE & EASY CARE: Soft and smooth, this modern duvet cover is finished with high-strength stitching and are low-maintenance. Machine wash in cold water, tumble dry low, and iron when needed. Please note this is a duvet cover set that doesn't include an insert or fill.<p> <p>✔COMPLETE DUVET BEDDING SET :- Enjoy a luxurious, picture-perfect look for your bed with THE SOCIAL CHEIF 3 Piece Duvet Cover Set. Simply slip it over your comforter, duvet insert, or alternative down comforter sets. This Duvet Covers is very useful, it will protect your comforter and is super easy to remove and wash.</p> <p>✔DURABLE & EASY CARE -: Soft and smooth, this modern duvet cover is finished with high-strength stitching and are low-maintenance. Machine wash in cold water, tumble dry low, and iron when needed. Please note this is a duvet cover set that doesn't include an insert or fill.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3JjVq0LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Social Chef","source_asin":"B0B15GSVHY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B15GSVHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B15GSVHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
