window.products.push({"id":169136,"name":"YnM Kids Exclusive Weighted Blanket, Soothing, Smallest Compartments with Glass Beads, Bed Blanket for One Person of 90lbs, Ideal for Twin Bed (41x60 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JhJWf-aqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton YNM EXCLUSIVE UPDATED VERSION: 2”x2” smallest compartments [Innovative Design] The 7-layer system design adapts to the curve of your body for optimal comfort and the 2x2-inch smallest sections allow for more equitable weight distribution. It includes more glass beads and less fiberfill for enhanced temperature regulation. In addition, a three-dimensional lock bead stitching method prevents leaking of beads. It has the finest stitching (0.25mm per stitch) to avoid movement of weight between compartments. All of these attributes make it a superb blanket. [Unique Sleeping Experience] YnM provides a natural means of calming the body for a good night's sleep. It is a wonderful sensory blanket for adults and children to help them relax and feel at ease. Great gifts for your loved ones. [Sizing Guide] To get the appropriate size for one adult, take 10% of your body weight and add 1 pound. Please select a weighted blanket measuring 80x87 inches or 88x104 inches for sharing. [Duvet Cover]: Breathable cotton/linen duvet cover, cooling bamboo duvet cover or cozy minky duvet cover are available in YnM. From YnM you can find a perfect duvet for you and for protection of your weighted blanket [Loops] It has 16 sturdy loops for securing the duvet cover (available separately) to prevent slippage. [Easy Care] Machine washable in a gentle setting. Tumble dry on a low setting or line dry. Use a mild detergent and avoid bleach. If you use YnM weighted blanket with a duvet cover, then you can just wash the light weight duvet cover instead of washing the heavy inner weighted blanket. [Reminder] Weighted blankets are not meant to hang off the edge of your bed. This concentrates weight into the areas where it is needed most. On you! So a weighted blanket is much smaller than an ordinary blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JhJWf-aqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YnM","source_asin":"B08ZRY3LWL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZRY3LWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZRY3LWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
