window.products.push({"id":169202,"name":"Noledar Decorative Farmhouse Throw Pillow Covers for Couch Bed Soft Flannel Solid Cushion Covers with Textured 18 x 18 Inch, Pack of 2, Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpDAIddDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flannel SUPER SOFT MATERIAL & SIZE: Made of flannel, not only pretty and super silky soft but also very durable! 2 pcs 18 x 18 inch pillow covers per pack is great price. COVERS ONLY. TEXTURED DESIGN: The herringbone textured design, make look stylish and gorgeous at the same time a little cute. Suitable decorate your sofa, bed, office, car, etc. INVISIBLE ZIPPER: The decorative throw pillow case is crafted with a hidden zipper that glides super easily and smoothly, creating an opening that favors the insertion or removal of the cushion without any effort. FRIENDLY: Pillow covers protect your pillow core from dust. Using environmental flannel fabric, no peculiar smell, friendly to pets and kids. EASY CARE & WASH: Flannel material stain resistant and fade resistant, hand wash cold, machine washable, and always look like new. Do not bleach, tumble dry low, do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpDAIddDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noledar","source_asin":"B08M61VWG4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M61VWG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M61VWG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169203,"name":"Intex Queen Dura-Beam Standard Series 20 Inch Thick Lightweight Inflatable Bed Air Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":97.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xe2x9347L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part of the new dura-beam standard series of airbeds, the essential rest airbed now features an interior made with Intex innovative fiber-tech construction which is comprised of thousands of high-strength polyester fibers that provide enhanced comfort, stability and support. The essential rest queen features a traditional bed height and cozy FLOCKED mattress top so guests will feel right at home, and they will love the better support and firmness that the fiber-tech construction brings. The built-in electric pump plugs right into your standard wall outlet and inflates the bed in about 3-and-a-half minutes so there is no need to rummage through the garage for your old electric pump or fuss with tiring hand or foot Pumps. Plus, it is loaded with features like the indented sides that help grip Fitted sheets, the outer perimeter frame on both top and bottom that provides additional stability and support, and the dual chamber construction that provides ample vertical stability. This air mattress is raised 20 inch from the floor for convenience, making it easier to get on and off of than some air mattresses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xe2x9347L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intex","source_asin":"B07F3DSNCB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F3DSNCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F3DSNCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
