window.products.push({"id":169303,"name":"BOSSIN 26 Bottle Wine Cooler Counter Top Wine Cellar Bar Fridge Quiet Operation Compressor Wine Cellar Freestanding Counter Top Wine Chiller- Cabinet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mnjxR0hpS._AC_SL1395_.jpg","description":"Description: Wine Cooler keeps your wine at the correct & consistent temperature and stable environment, protecting the wine from exterior lights and elements, and is specially built to have zero vibration, so the wine could be aged and stored properly, enabling it to preserve and develop its delicious flavor, Color and Aroma, with the best possible mouthfeel, body, palette and finish, serving you the best and tastiest wine that is Full, Rich, Supple, Smooth, Round, and Balanced. A Must Have for Wine Lovers and Collectors. Feature: No Noise: Low noise and vibration, will not disturb sediment. Energy-efficient cooling system, to minimize the vibration effect and noise. So you can fall asleep in a quiet environment without worrying about the noise that will affect you. this wine chiller is also perfect for use at the office, it won't affect your work. Adjustable Temperature: The digital control panel has a temperature range of 40°F- 61°F degree Fahrenheit. It's located on the exterior of the unit, so you don't have to worry about disturbing the temperature of your wine when making adjustments. The largest wine cabinet is equipped with a touch panel, and the other two wine cabinets have a rotating temperature button that can be adjusted to the temperature you want. Sealing and UV protect : Double Pane Glass Door, with good sealing to ensure an interior odor-free environment that maintains constant humidity, keeping the cork from drying out, thus preventing more air to come into contact with the wine, also to ensure darkness, blocking out sunlight and harmful UV rays that breaks down the complex molecules that create the special flavors in properly aged wines. Specifications: Capacity: 90L/26 bottles Weight:48.5 lbs Shipping weight:55.1 lbs Unit Dimensions:W17.5*D18.7*H31.5 in Temperature Range","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mnjxR0hpS._AC_SL1395_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSSIN","source_asin":"B07QQXTMWK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QQXTMWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QQXTMWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
