window.products.push({"id":169328,"name":"Rink Drink 2 Piece Balloon Gin Glass Set - Large Copa Style Bowl Glass - 690ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SMl-NtocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of Rink Drink Gin glasses elegantly balances a smooth sophisticated shape with comfort, poise and practicality.To formulate to perfect gin glass we took inspiration from the silhouette of the classic Spanish Copa de Balon Gin Glass. These exaggerated, oversized bowl shapes provide the opportunity for a true connoisseur's cocktail experience, giving ample room for crushed ice, fruits and botanicals to sit and infuse. A sturdy, elongated stem keeps hands clear of the bowl, keeping your beverage cooler for longer.Capable of holding a huge 690ml of liquid, these glasses serve as the perfect vessel for luscious Gin and Tonics, Pina Coladas, Punches and Spritzes.Whether you're shopping for business or pleasure, when it comes to products that effortlessly straddle the gap between fashion and function, the Rink Drink collection does not fall short. Shop the range today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SMl-NtocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rink Drink","source_asin":"B085VY35NZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085VY35NZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085VY35NZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
