window.products.push({"id":169416,"name":"Peugeot Zeli Electric Salt & Pepper Mill Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ALpX8HQ1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COMPACT MILLS — With a single touch, the Zeli electric mills light up to deliver freshly ground spices. Bring a contemporary touch to your kitchen. Simply press the button for a quick one-handed operation. Developed in France by Peugeot GRIND SETTINGS — Our patented system helps you select your desired grind. Turn the wheel of regulation for a finer grind and counterclockwise for a coarser grind. Made in France, the two-stage grinding mechanism first effortlessly cracks and then grinds the peppercorns and salt to the desired coarseness PRECISION GRIND — Through two centuries of experience, we have expertly engineered each mill and mechanism specifically for the consistency and shape of peppercorns and salt crystals. Make sure to fill each one with the correct spice for optimum use. We make the gear mechanism from steel resistant to corrosion and rust ENHANCE FLAVOR — Create your precise balance of flavor with the Zeli electric salt and pepper mill. Salt makes meat juicier and balances other flavors. Finely ground pepper will bring out its spice, while a coarser grind intensifies the flavor. Find your Peugeot moment and enjoy the art of French living with our instruments of taste READY TO SEASON — Our salt mills come with Cristaux de sel blanc d'Allemagne, a dry white rock salt from Germany, and our pepper mills with Tan Hoi black pepper from Vietnam (refill cubes are available from Peugeot). Fill with dry rock salt only (max size smaller than 1/6 inch/4mm) — do not use sea salt, and max size ¼-inch (6mm) peppercorns CONTEMPORARY LOOK — Zeli mill mechanisms are housed in ABS material with a brushed metal look. Add that contemporary touch, with this efficient, compact mill that fits perfectly into your hand. Comes with six AAA batteries and a spare bulb. To replace, remove the top section and unlock the motor from its housing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ALpX8HQ1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B002S58RDW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002S58RDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002S58RDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
