window.products.push({"id":169422,"name":"Libbey Classic Sangria/Beer Glasses, Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PVYZBmuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Libbey Classic 12-piece Sangria/Beer Glass Set turns all your occasions into singular events. Their balanced weight and shape make them easy to hold and hard to tip over. Designed to enhance chilled sangria or quality beers, the wide-topped, large-bowled glasses instantly upgrade your collection with a dozen multipurpose vessels. Celebrate This! with Glassware from Libbey If you’ve ever sipped from a glass, odds are you’ve already met Libbey. We rank as the top glassware manufacturer in the Americas and one of the largest tableware suppliers in the world. As the runaway leader, we are setting new standards for stability, strength, and growth opportunity. We believe every occasion — big and small — is an opportunity to celebrate life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PVYZBmuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Libbey","source_asin":"B009XI0Y1K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009XI0Y1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009XI0Y1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169423,"name":"BALIBETOV Yerba Mate Gourd Set (Original Natural Handmade Yerba Mate Cup Argentina) - Includes Mate Tea Cup, Bombilla (Yerba Mate Straw) and Clean Bru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PVA7unDGL._AC_SL1390_.jpg","description":"NATURAL MATE SET - Balibetov traditional Calabash Gourd set is handmade in Argentina from a complete natural fruit. The set includes A calabash Mate Gourd, a stainless steel Bombilla straw and a cleaning brush. The carved design ring rim details make each piece a work of art. Enjoy the Mate - A Beverage rich in antioxidants and nutrients the original way, with an all-Natural Gourd! ABOUT A CALABASH GOURD - The Calabash (pumpkin) Gourd is a completely natural fruit, the brown color comes as a result of the roasting of the fruit. Each Gourd has a unique shape varying a bit one from the other. Made from the fruit of 'Legenaria' it's the traditional and original way in which Mate is taken. SIZE - Mate gourd capacity is 7 oz I 200 ml approximately, no two are the same. Some are bigger, some are smaller. Nature does not repeat - it creates. Bombilla straw is 5.5 inch I 14 cm long. GREAT GIFT - The real way to enjoy the Mate experience is in a natural Mate cup and Bombilla, a great way to drink it traditionally or as a South american souvenir made of a complete natural fruit. The fruit provides an exquisite taste to the beverage. It is an ideal product for personal use or as a beautiful gift. CURING PROCESS IS REQUIRED - The Gourd arrives with the interior of the dry fruit peeling requesting each customer to cure the fruit before any use to seal the pores, avoid bitterness and cracks. The packaging includes an Instruction manual with clear steps on how to cure, prepare and maintain this authentic set! Natural Gourds are fragile and can get damaged during the shipping process, please contact us and give us the chance to rectify the problem. Your satisfaction is our main priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PVA7unDGL._AC_SL1390_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALIBETOV","source_asin":"B07S5GZ2HP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5GZ2HP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5GZ2HP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
