window.products.push({"id":169426,"name":"Deco Window 60\" Garden Torch Set of 4 Metal Casted Outdoor Backyard Patio Lighting Citronella Oil Lamp with Snuffer & Fiberglass Wick (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vygX0+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Deco Window Set of 4 60\" Garden Torch Citronella Oil Lamp with Snuffer & Fiberglass Wick (Brown) Transform your urban dwelling into a tropical paradise with these citronella oil garden torches. Perfect for outdoor spaces like balconies, patios, decks, lawns, or gardens, these garden torches provide a traditional, fun, and natural way to light up your outdoor areas. This set of 4 metal torches stands at 60 inches tall and can be easily converted into full-sized or mid-sized torches, providing versatility in height options. Specifications: Material: Iron Material: Iron Length: 64\" (Full Size) | 44\" (Mid Size) Length: 64\" (Full Size) | 44\" (Mid Size) Snuffer Included: Yes Snuffer Included: Yes Wick Material: Fiberglass Wick Material: Fiberglass Oil Capacity: 8.45 Oz Oil Capacity: 8.45 Oz ColorL Brown ColorL Brown PREMIUM IRON CONSTRUCTION: Crafted with high-quality iron metal, these torches are designed to accentuate the ambiance of your garden. With intricate detailing and a realistic style, these torches add charm and elegance to any outdoor setting. FIBERGLASS WICK & SNUFFER: Equipped with an extra-large fiberglass wick, these torches offer improved fuel flow and longer burn times. The attached metal snuffer makes it easy to extinguish the flames when needed. 8.45 Oz TORCH FUEL CAPACITY: These outdoor torches are designed to hold up to 8.45Oz of citronella fuel, providing up to six hours of burn time. The wide-mouth openings make refilling a breeze without any spillage, ensuring a hassle-free experience. VERSATILE USAGE: These torches are ideal for various outdoor occasions such as walkway lighting, landscape decorations, garden parties, Halloween festivals, Christmas decorations, weddings, barbeque parties, and more. They create a perfect natural ambience for your outdoor gatherings and events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718vygX0+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECO HOME","source_asin":"B00NV5ZF4W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NV5ZF4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NV5ZF4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169427,"name":"Max & Lily Modern Farmhouse Low Loft Bed, Twin Bed Frame For Kids With 1 Drawer, Barnwood Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811+I-hhKFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drawer is the perfect combination of fun and functional that both kids and parents love. The solid wood bed frame adds strength and stability. Included storage drawer and shelf organizes and displays your favorite items. The large underbed space is perfect for play or storing larger items. A bedside tray is ideal for holding your cups and bedtime stories. At only 41.5 inches tall, this space-saving loft bed is great for smaller rooms and younger children. This kids loft bed features tall, 15-inch guardrails, so the low loft bed safely fits standard mattress sizes. Angled ladder with rounded edges offers comfortable, easy climbing. Added bonus – ladder, storage and play area can be installed on either side of the twin loft bed during assembly. This loft bed for kids uses a durable, low VOC finish that’s ideal for your clean and healthy home. Finish features a unique barwood look that pairs perfectly with your existing kids room furniture and other Drawer farmhouse pieces. Variations in color and coating may occur. Flush, color-matched hardware give these kids loft beds a clean look. Instructions, slat roll, and required hardware are included. With solid plywood slats and a metal support bar, this twin loft bed with storage can support 400 lbs. of resting weight. 2+ adults make assembly simple and easy. This loft bed with storage meets or exceeds Federal safety standards for kids furniture. When it’s time for play, this loft beds space-saving twin bed frame frees up plenty of floor space. The Modern Farmhouse Low Loft Bed with 1 drawer from Max & Lily offers exceptional quality and affordability that kids and their parents will enjoy for years to come. Max & Lily is a member of the Maxwood family of brands – the kids furniture experts bringing a tradition of superior quality, safety and fun!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811+I-hhKFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B0B3F1WC7N","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3F1WC7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3F1WC7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169428,"name":"Stanley Quencher H2.0 FlowState Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler with Lid and Straw for Water, Iced Tea or Coffee, Smoothie and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tyI85oyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Constructed of recycled stainless steel for sustainable sipping, our 40 oz Quencher H2.0 offers maximum hydration with fewer refills. Commuting, studio workouts, day trips or your front porch—you’ll want this tumbler by your side. Thanks to Stanley’s vacuum insulation, your water will stay ice-cold, hour after hour. The advanced FlowState™ lid features a rotating cover with three positions: a straw opening designed to resist splashes while holding the reusable straw in place, a drink opening, and a full-cover top. The ergonomic handle includes comfort-grip inserts for easy carrying, and the narrow base fits just about any car cup holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tyI85oyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stanley","source_asin":"B0BZ9SMM53","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ9SMM53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ9SMM53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
