window.products.push({"id":169511,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser,Touchless foaming soap Dispenser with Infrared Sensor,Waterproof Foam Soap Dispenser Hands-Free for Bathroom Kitchen Countert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pT-oAqZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Touchless Automatic Soap Dispenser -【1 Year Replacement】 👏 Features: 1).Dust Proof - Nobidah auto foam dispense has a dust-proof design on the top.Unlike other dispensers,which will have dust after long-term use; Nobidah dispenser will prevent dust and keep dispenser clean all the time. 2).Latest Precise Infrared Motion Sensor - Just place hand under the nozzle,the plastic soap dispenser will dispense a perfectly measured amount of soap.Nobidahh automatic foam soap dispenser provides more rich foam precisely with less time without touch the foaming soap dispenser. 3).Water Resistant & Leak-Proof - High quality IPX4 waterproof material protects the auto soap dispenser from water damage and corrosion.You could Keep the 350ml Touchless Soap dispenser on bathroom or kitchen. 4).Transparent & Scale Design - You will know the remaining soap at any time and when to refill. 5).Battery-Operated - Nobidah kitchen soap dispenser is more safe than charger,just rotate the top of the foam dispenser.Insert 4AAAA 1.5V batteries and then close the cover,and turn on through press the top button.(Batteries are not included) 6).Tech Gifts - The soap dispenser is very simple in appearance,which makes hand-wash a smart choice,adding an elegant style at home in the bathroom,kitchen,offices,hotel,school,hospital and etc. Package - 1*Soap Foam Dispenser;1* Nozzle; 1*User Manual. 1 Year Service - We provide 1 year service for Nobidah Soap Dispenser.Please feel free to contact-seller if you have any question. 【Easy to use】: 1).Insert the nozzle(included). 2).Rotate to open the top cover,then install 4 AAAA batteries (please note \"+/-\" of the battery) 3).Pour in washing liquid. 4).Press the button on top. 5).You will get rich foam when your hand close to the nozzle of the automatic foam dispenser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pT-oAqZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nobidah","source_asin":"B09WV15W1F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WV15W1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WV15W1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
