window.products.push({"id":169568,"name":"16\" Round Tempered Glass Table Top 1/2\" Thick 1\" Beveled Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+9xsM4oRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16\" ROUND GLASS TOPS Features: Finest quality furniture glass Edges and corners expertly polished Expertly packed to ensure safe arrival Glass is individually cartoned with styrofoam protection Free bumpons included to place between glass tops & base 16\" ROUND GLASS TOPSThe 16\" Round Glass Top is made of the finest quality furniture glass. This clear glass tabletop features a 1\" bevel edge and is ½\" thick with a weight of 18 lbs. The edges of the glass are expertly polished to ensure a bright, smooth to the touch feel. The beveled, or chamfered edge is commonly and widely used with glass and mirror for aesthetics and safety so there are no sharp or rough edges.This small round glass top is perfect to use as a replacement glass or use to create a beautiful accent table, glass end table or small coffee table. Glass top tables are popular since they can easily fit in with a wide variety of home decor and style of a room. This is a perfect addition to your living room, dining room or bedroom. These contemporary glass tops are available in many sizes, thicknesses and edgework.Each round glass top includes free bumpons to place in between the glass and base of the table. They are expertly packed and individually packaged with Styrofoam to protect from breakage during transit. The 16\" clear round glass tabletop ships quickly via Fedex and is also insured to ensure a safe arrival.Shopping for Round Glass Tops online is easy at Glass Tops Direct. We feature many variations in size, shape, thickness and edge work as well as custom glass sizes. Whether you are purchasing a glass top as a replacement or as a table protector, we offer the highest quality glass at the best prices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+9xsM4oRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spancraft Glass","source_asin":"B001E6D00G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E6D00G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E6D00G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
