window.products.push({"id":169629,"name":"Music Notes Birthday Party Supplies Set Plates Napkins Cups Tableware Kit for 16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911g4jGSbDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM DESIGN - Our Music Themed Party Supplies are suitable for girl’s and boy’s birthday parties, holiday celebrations with your family and friends, special events or for just fun-filled daily meals, snacks, and desserts with picnics and cookouts. Shrieks of joy will be your reward when you use these fun and unique party tableware sets. DURABLE AND HIGH QUALITY - Brightly colored matte laminate designs help to prevent saturation. Birthday Galore party plates and cups are made from the highest-quality card stock giving superior durability for cake, ice cream, and more. Cups are reinforced with polyethylene coating to prevent leaks and give added rigidity while tightly rolled rims offer comfortable sipping. If any foods or beverages spill or drip, you can count on our hardy 2-ply napkins for quick clean up. WHAT’S INCLUDED IN PACKAGE – Our party pack serves up to 16 guests. The pack includes 16 dessert plates that are 7 inches, 16 napkins that are 6.5 inches, and 16 cups that hold 9 ounces of beverage. MORE TIME TO ENJOY – Our party tableware can be arranged creatively on your cake table to enhance your party decorations and make a stunning photo backdrop. Tableware is disposable for easy clean up. When the party ends simply dispose of everything and then relax. ECO-FRIENDLY – Birthday Galore paper plates, paper cups, and napkins are food safe, made of 100% food grade material. They are also biodegradable and recyclable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911g4jGSbDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birthday Galore","source_asin":"B06XZ39ZJ6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZ39ZJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZ39ZJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169630,"name":"Pavilion Gift Company Grandma's Pie Plate, 9-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6cWxY0AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Well seasoned by pavilion is a humorous and cheerful collection of mugs and kitchen accessories as well as a gift collection of magnets and block figurines. The cool, whimsical seniors featured on these items have an optimistic image and light-hearted attitude about their golden years. Each piece features bright colors, embossed detail and textured accents with an amusing quip, which will surely get a chuckle out of anyone. Everything in this collection would make a unique gift for the \"hip senior\" in your life, letting them know that...\"they're not old, they're well seasoned\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6cWxY0AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavilion Gift Company","source_asin":"B008B4R88E","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008B4R88E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008B4R88E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169631,"name":"artgeist Canvas Prints Wall Art Abstract 80x40 in - 5pcs Home Decor Framed Stretched Picture Photo Painting Artwork for Living Room Abstraction Modern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911CcUgArZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANVAS PICTURES Printed pictures are trending lately when it comes to interior designing – they serve as an alternative to classic paintings.High quality materials and large-format printers give us the opportunity to recreate even the tiniest details of the copied photography. Pictures are also UV-resistant and this is why colors are sharper than ever. Every picture is stretched over a wooden frame – you don’t need to worry about any additional utilities in order to put it on the wall. To make sure that the painting will look great on your wall, we mount the canvas onto a matched stretcher bar made of Natureeeal, solid wood (1,5 cm thick).We offer a whole variety of different themed pictures, that will give you the possibility to make your surroundings lovelier and hopefully unlock your inner creativity. The highest possible quality and modern approach will surely meet your expectations as a client.Also, keep in mind - we do not offer stocked items - every order is being produced individually after the purchase. Products are made exclusively in our own manufacturing facilities – hence, we offer the best quality vs. price ratio. IMPORTANT In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a certain distance between them (compare it with the picture displayed online).Please keep in mind that because of the screen settings, actual colours may vary from the ones visible on the picture online. Pictures are only displayed for illustration purposes. They serve as an exemplar of how the canvas print might look like in a particular surrounding. Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.It's possible only to send 3 products in one package, so if you want to order more products, please submit an appropriate number of individual orders.All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911CcUgArZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B07N3TGM3X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N3TGM3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N3TGM3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
