window.products.push({"id":169738,"name":"Vanity Table Set with Lighted Mirror and Stool, Vintage Makeup Dressing Table with Drawers w/Storage Cabinet, 3 Color LED Lighting Modes Adjustable Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQ1f8eCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional vanity set:This vanity table set is consist of 1x Dresser table, 1x Cabinet, 1xStool, 1xMirror. The cabinet is free combination, it can be adjusted according to the actual space of the bedroom. It can be seperately used and put besides of the table or close to the table, it also can put under the vanity table as you like. The table also can be used as a sturdy desk by removing the mirror. The total product size: 31.5\"W x 15.7\"D x 51.2\"H ☆Dimmable design&adjustable brightness: The touch screen dimming mirror has three lighting modes for you to choose: COOL WHITE, WARM WHITE, WARM YELLOW.Built in 3 color LED light bar, click the inner touch button in the mirror, you can freely adjust the color brightness according to different scenes and makeup needs. The touch switch allows wet hands to operate properly and very safe to use ☆Sturdy and durable: Made of high quality pine material, the table top and the drawer material is high quality density board, sturdy black iron leg are strong enough to hold the table set stable. It's durable and ideal for long-term use. Premium paint allow you very easy to clean, just wipe with a damp cloth. ☆Large storage capacity: Equipped with 4 drawers of different sizes and combined with the desktop, the vanity table provides spacious space for you to store cosmetics and other necessities. One of the drawers is a jewelry organizer covering with soft flannel to give your jewelry the best protection. You can neatly hold your necklaces, bracelets, rings, earrings, and bangles in the drawer. In addition, we will give you a transparent storage organizer for free ☆Modern and comfortable vanity set: With a simple and modern style, this vanity table set is the best addition to your bedroom. The cushioned stool is soft and filled with high density sponge, which offers maximun comfort for you to do your makeup and hair. Perfet gift for your wife, love, daughter. This vanity table and stool set can be used in your bedroom, bathroom, closet, or hallway","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQ1f8eCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moxeay","source_asin":"B09DYVS67Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYVS67Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYVS67Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
