window.products.push({"id":169740,"name":"Vedouci Square Stitching Tassel Tablecloth Heavy Weight Polyester Fabric Dust-Proof Table Cover for Kitchen Dining Table Top Decoration(Square,55''x55","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rM3czPDVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿ ANTI-WRINKLE & ANTI-SHRINK: Vedouci square tablecloth combines the comfort of cotton and the firming of hemp with the perfect proportion, which is more wrinkle free and shrink-proof than other materials. ✿ ANTI-FADING TABLECLOTH: Vedouci Polyester tablecloth is dyeing with new technology and high-quality dyes, good fixing effect, not easy to fade after long time of using and washing. ✿ MULTIPLE APPLICATION: This gray tablecloth is suitable for indoor and outdoor use, patio, picnic, gardens, kitchen room, dining room, and family room, cafes, special occasions, party, Christmas holidays. ✿ WASHING TIPS: Hand washing can better maintain and lengthen the life of the square tablecloth on account of cotton and linen texture. Of course, you can also put the tablecloth into the laundry bag and wash it with the gentle gear of the washing machine to avoid the strong throwing; Dryer drying or lay flat to dry; Vedouci Polyester square tablecloths can be easily ironed to make the table cloth more smooth and compliant if necessary. ✿ Tips: Please kindly measure your table before purchasing, the size of table cloth usually larger than the size of the table. Any problems with the size selection and the quality, please don't hesitate to contact us. Vedouci are always here for helping service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rM3czPDVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vedouci","source_asin":"B085C7LFC3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085C7LFC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085C7LFC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169741,"name":"4 Pack Survival Kit Can Opener, Military, P-51 Model","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZR28oV1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is the bigger brother of the P-38 military can opener made famous in WWII. It's about twice the size and much easier to use compared to the smaller P38. The P-51 military can opener is a full 2\" long. This added length affords more leverage when opening cans and does not require as much thumb pressure to use. Excellent for emergency back-up if you store any type of canned goods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZR28oV1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"US Shelby CO","source_asin":"B00ZTDNWN0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZTDNWN0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZTDNWN0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169742,"name":"Divinity Braid v4 Purple Lilac Celtic Heart Knot Wedding Handfasting Cord #Handfasting #Celtic #CelticHandfasting #Wedding #WeddingHandfasting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fCSqadyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Wedding Handfasting Cord is  Elegantly hand Braided with high-quality double-faced satin ribbon.  It makes this handfasting cord a chic keepsake. I use the 5/8\"ribbon and is very beautiful and dainty.   Its the simplicity that adds to the sophistication.  Its hand-braided to 6 ft braided in 5/8\"  double-faced satin ribbon in Lilac, Purple & Ivory with 2  TierraCast Pewter Celtic  Heart Knot Charms (One on each end) attached to pewter TierraCast ribbon ends to complete the elegance of this cord.   Easy to wrap and tie for the vows. This classy cord is lovely for such a beautiful ceremony.   Great for the traditional vows of the handfasting.  (Or renewing your vows) Makes a Great prop for pics after the ceremony. Comes with Organza Bag. **Props are NOT included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fCSqadyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Divinity Braid","source_asin":"B07QXD56TD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QXD56TD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QXD56TD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
