window.products.push({"id":169764,"name":"G.W. Schleidt STC8002-M Newton Gravity Glass Timer 2 Minute Magenta Sand 8-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G4NFKD6dL._AC_.jpg","description":"A sand timer is a centuries-old device that uses sand and gravity to measure time. In this ingenious G.W. Schleidt design, inspired by 17th century physicist Isaac Newton, the sand timer is suspended in a clear liquid within a glass cylinder. When the apparatus is inverted, the sand slowly trickles downward within the sand timer, while the timer itself slowly floats upward in the liquid. Measures 2-minute increments and contains magenta sand; also available with blue and purple sand. Overall height is 8 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G4NFKD6dL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G W Schleidt","source_asin":"B003VWBR7E","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VWBR7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VWBR7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169765,"name":"10 pc Glass Jars with Bamboo Lids (16oz) + Rewritable Label Set | Big Clear Glass Airtight Spice Jars | Food Storage Containers for Home Kitchen, Tea,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-CIoM+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"10 JARS FOR MORE USEFUL ORGANIZING: When it comes to spice collections, more is definitely better. So that’s why we created a set of 10 Jars, Lids & Rewritable Labels (…instead of the usual 8), so you can store even more spices and items with matching pantry organization and storage! AIRTIGHT BAMBOO WOOD LIDS: Nothing beats the sound of the ‘pop’ as the air is sucked out of glass storage containers. And when you open Kaptivating Kitchens small glass jars and hear that sound from our airtight rubber seal, you’ll know the contents inside are as fresh as the day you stored them. STRONG BOROSCILICATE GLASS: Our 16 oz spice jars are built for a lifetime, and 100% Dishwasher Safe (handwash lids). And while we can’t vouch for the hardness of your floors, we can say even if you knock a spice jar off the shelf in cooking frenzy, there’s a good chance it’ll remain unbroken. BONUS 16 REWRITABLE LABELS! These 16oz storage jars have 3 x 4.5” of storage space inside and can be used for herb, seed or candy jars, party favors and goodies, apothecary jars, bathroom storage and more! Just fill them up with cute food and then create a label using our pantry labels. BEAUTIFUL GIFT BOX PACKAGING ! 16 ounce glass jars with lids are great, but with rewritable labels they’re even better! So remember them as a Mother’s Day Gift or Housewarming Gift for someone who loves kitchen organization and storage, too. Order your set of 10 glass containers with lids and labels, now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-CIoM+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaptivating Kitchens","source_asin":"B09LSPZJ43","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LSPZJ43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LSPZJ43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":169766,"name":"Steelcase Think Leather Chair, Black Open Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fd4mQdTNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Think is the chair with a brain and a conscience. As you sit and change position throughout your workday, it senses what you need and immediately responds, adjusting itself intuitively to provide support in all the right places. Innovative back flexors hug your spine and work in concert with flexors in the seat, automatically changing shape to follow and support your moves. Lean forward, lean back, and the chair tracks with you, leveraging your body weight to make every movement smooth. Think feels good, from the first moment you sit to the last. And as considerate as Think is of your comfort, it's equally considerate of the environment. It's made with up to 37-percent recycled content and is 98-percent recyclable by weight. Steelcase Think Chair complete features are black base, standard upholstered seat and back, adjustable height pivot depth arms, hard casters and leather. From the Manufacturer The Think Chair Think is the chair with a brain and a conscience. As you sit and change position throughout your workday, it senses what you need and immediately responds, adjusting itself intuitively to provide support in all the right places. Innovative back flexors hug your spine and work in concert with flexors in the seat, automatically changing shape to follow and support your moves. Lean forward, lean back, and the chair tracks with you, leveraging your body weight to make every movement smooth. Think feels good, from the first moment you sit to the last. And as considerate as Think is of your comfort, it’s equally considerate of the environment. It’s made with up to 37% recycled content and is 98% recyclable by weight. Think. The chair with a brain and a conscience. A chair intelligent enough to understand how you sit, and adjust itself intuitively. A chair thoughtful enough to measure, and minimize, its lifelong impact on the environment. It’s almost as if the chair could think. Think before you create. Think is the brainchild of three disciplines. It has the clean, sophisticated aesthetic the designer hoped for, the technological intuitiveness the engineer desired and the complete sustainability the environmentalists sought. Think comfortably. Think senses what your body needs, then delivers it. Each flexor in the backrest is individually contoured to provide optimum support for that area of the back. Now that’s smart comfort! Think intuitively. Because the seat is weight-activated and the back moves with your body, any body can get comfortable. There are a few manual adjustments, but they don’t require a manual to explain. Think globally. The Think chair was developed by an international team, and is manufactured in North America, Europe, and Asia. It’s available around the world, but it’s perfectly at home at your desk, wherever you are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fd4mQdTNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steelcase","source_asin":"B007IEQSG6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007IEQSG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007IEQSG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
