window.products.push({"id":169821,"name":"Root Unscented Grecian Collenettes Dinner Candles, 5-Inch, Box of 8, Chanterelle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tIm4f1LL._AC_.jpg","description":"First impressions are lasting impressions and the subtle grace of unscented, beeswax-enriched collenettes linger well past the occasion. Collenettes have a distinctive profile that lend themselves to even the most formal events. Box of 8 candles, each 5-inches tall. Wide, 1.25-inch diameter virtually assures a flawless performance by eliminating drips; the 7/8-inch tapered base is compatible with most fine candleholders. Grecian finish is reminiscent of classical times with balanced folds that capture the soft light and contrasting shadows for an inspired effect. Root candles is an iconic American company that traces its lineage back to 1869 when founder, amos ives root, first opened his doors for business in medina, ohio. Since then, 5 generations of root candle-makers have created the best candles in America. As an innovator and visionary, A. I. root believed deeply in the American values of honesty, integrity, and plain old hard work; 140 years later, those values remain at the core of root's culture. Root candles crafts products of uncompromising quality. Using all-natural materials for purity and balance, our candles seduce your senses, enhance your living space and soothe your soul. Our candles are manufactured according to all astm (safety) standards. We manufacture our own all-natural cotton wicks; we test burn 1,000 candles per day, checking fragrance throw, emissions, soot, flame strength, stability, end of useful life, welling, dripping, and burn time. Stringent color matching is done daily to ensure consistent quality from batch to batch. Root has combined the time honored methods of early 20th century hand crafted candle making, with 21st century automation technologies, to continue a renowned tradition and reputation. Every root candle is made in the USA, on the same plot of land our founder, amos ives root, purchased over 100 years ago. Today, root candles continues traditional standards of superior candle craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tIm4f1LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B01CL3FALW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CL3FALW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CL3FALW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
