window.products.push({"id":169926,"name":"TUBBEASE Hoof Soaking Boot with EVA Sole Insert Bundle - The Ultimate Hoof Treatment for Horses - Essential Horse Care Equine Equipment – (Contains 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tz59SlUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WARNING: CHOOSE YOUR SIZE CAREFULLY! -- View our Fitting Video Guide before Selecting Your Size. Tubbease Size Indicates Maximum Internal Diameter of Hoof Sock NOT Hoof Measurement. Ensure Hoof Measurement Fits WITHIN Tubbease Size. Correct Fitting is Crucial to the Success of Tubbease and the Comfort of Your Horse or Pony. ESSENTIAL HOOF CARE -- Tubbease is the Ultimate Short-Term Equine Treatment Boot for a Variety of Hoof Problems in Horses & Ponies Including Laminitis, Abscess, Seedy Toe, Thrush, Thin Soles and Compromised or Damaged Hooves. The PVC-Moulded Sock is Perfect for Hoof Soaking but Can Be Used over Hoof Wraps and Dressings for Wound Protection and Cleanliness. The EVA Sole Insert (sold separately) adds an Additional Layer of Comfort for Sensitive Soles. A SOLUTION THAT LETS HOOVES BREATHE NATURALLY -- Other Sealed Poultice and Soaking Boots Can Prevent the Hoof from Breathing which in Turn, Softens the Hoof and Inhibits the Healing Process. Tubbease’ PVC-moulded Hoof Sock ‘Breathes’ whilst still Protecting and Soaking the Damaged Hoof and Can be Quickly and Easily Applied Without the Need for Dressings and Tape. DESIGNED AND DEVELOPED IN NEW ZEALAND -- The Tubbease Hoof Sock was Designed in New Zealand by a Local Farrier, and Developed by Shoof International Ltd. The Hoof Sock Solves the Problem many Farriers Face of Poulticing Hooves Without ‘Stewing’ them. USE IN CONFINED SPACES ONLY -- Tubbease is a Short-Term Treatment Hoof Boot Best Used on Horses in Enclosed Spaces/Stable or Yard (Non Turnout). Don't let Lameness Cripple Your Horses - Keep Tubbease Handy in your Stable's Veterinary Kit to Combat Hoof Problems that May Occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tz59SlUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUBBEASE","source_asin":"B07ZJ4KTD6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJ4KTD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJ4KTD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
