window.products.push({"id":169959,"name":"Anna Stay Tea Mugs with Infuser and Lid - Tea Cups with Strainer for Loose Leaf Tea, Our Tea Mug set of 2 makes a Beautiful Gifts For Tea Lovers, Porc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LLStZH8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s nothing quite like the taste of fresh-brewed tea in big tea cups with infusers and lid, especially when you can make it in the comfort of your own kitchen. That’s why we created the The Tea Couple tea mugs with lids that makes it quick and easy to steep loose-leaf tea and create rich, delicious teas in minutes. And because each individual cup offers a more personal experience over a full teapot, everyone can choose the strength and flavor of their very own. Crafted with elegant porcelain, these cute tea cups feature ultra-fine mesh inserts and lids to let you steep a single cup of tea right at your kitchen table, while you’re reading a book, or while you’re relaxing in the living room. And because each set comes with two teacups and two heat-resistant coasters, it makes the perfect gift for couples, partners, and friends who want to start off each morning or unwind in the evening, together. Add Grounds or Leaves Start by adding just the right amount of fresh loose-leaf tea in the tea cup with strainer to help you get the right flavor and balance. Let Steep and Brew Once the tea leaves and hot water have been added to their respective cups, simply add it to the tea cup, put it in the infuse, put on the lid, and let steep for approximately 5 minutes. Remove the Infuser When you’re ready to start enjoying your tea, remove the lid and the infuser (careful not to spill the remnants) Enjoy Fresh-Brewed Tea the Tea mugs set designed to hold up to 14 oz. of your favorite tea flavor or blend, you can empty the infuser or reuse it to have multiple cups of tea. Product Details: Infuser Tea Mugs with lid (Set of 2) Infuser Tea Mugs with lid (Set of 2) Heat-Resistant, Non-Slip Coasters (2) Heat-Resistant, Non-Slip Coasters (2) Grade-A Porcelain Craftsmanship Grade-A Porcelain Craftsmanship Freedom Colors and Patterns Freedom Colors and Patterns Microwave and Dishwasher Safe Microwave and Dishwasher Safe Cup Volume: 14 oz. (Each) Cup Volume: 14 oz. (Each)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LLStZH8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRIVETRUNNER -ANNA STAY","source_asin":"B08JQM17M3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JQM17M3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JQM17M3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
