window.products.push({"id":169981,"name":"HonHey Handheld Fan, 2PCS Super Mini Personal Fan with Rechargeable Battery Operated 3 Adjustable Speed, Portable Handheld Fan for Girls Women Kids Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61em6UeaNQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[Super Mini Pocket Size]: 6.7 x 3.2 x 0.95-inch in size and 0.19-lb in weight, portable design for girls and kids using outdoor. Small as a phone that you can easily keep this mini handheld fan with you at office,on the go or at home, so you can use it whenever you want. Also it can be a makeup fan which would not take up too much space to storage. [Strong Wind]: Honhey mini fan equip powerful DC motor(120hrs continous working time) to improve working efficiency, offer a fast rotation speed with low nosie. It's the fastest motor rotation speed up to 5800RPM, which make you feel the airflow even from 10ft away.In such a hot summer this cute mini fan will help you keep cool when you are travelling, hiking or camping outside and keep your face dry. [7 Blades and Quiet]: What's the advantages of 7 blades? This new design can bring more breeze and divide the wind into 7 pieces evenly for reducing noise and delivering a gentle breeze without disturbing others. [3 Speeds Adjustable]: This mini handheld fan has 3 adjustable speeds which can be switched easily by pressing the button. Low speed for a soft breeze at 3300RPM that can accompany you sleeping quietly. Medium speed for cool wind, and high speed produces strong airflow at 5800RPM rotation speed, help you cool down in seconds. In a word, HonHey mini fan can be a good helper for your hot flashes. [USB Rechargeable Battery]: 1800mAh Rechargeable battery ensure HonHey mini fan's high-performance and high-efficiency, longer battery using time,safe charge and less power consumption. Get charge by USB devices such as powerbank, computer, laptop, USB charger, is able to continuous work when connectting with a usb power supply. and it takes 3 hours to get fully charged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61em6UeaNQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HonHey","source_asin":"B0B4JS3Y3T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-169981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JS3Y3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JS3Y3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
